{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/compare/ea22b3c3055d0c6d40f213273138103fbc98cee3...e3baf9323b06a1fb66d3a506b7430f9f10cd7854","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/compare/ea22b3c3055d0c6d40f213273138103fbc98cee3...e3baf9323b06a1fb66d3a506b7430f9f10cd7854","permalink_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/compare/kevinrhaas:ea22b3c...kevinrhaas:e3baf93","diff_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/compare/ea22b3c3055d0c6d40f213273138103fbc98cee3...e3baf9323b06a1fb66d3a506b7430f9f10cd7854.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/compare/ea22b3c3055d0c6d40f213273138103fbc98cee3...e3baf9323b06a1fb66d3a506b7430f9f10cd7854.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"ea22b3c3055d0c6d40f213273138103fbc98cee3","node_id":"C_kwDOUoK9jtoAKGVhMjJiM2MzMDU1ZDBjNmQ0MGYyMTMyNzMxMzgxMDNmYmM5OGNlZTM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Kevin Haas","email":"kevinroberthaas@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-23T16:15:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-10-23T16:15:04Z"},"message":"T-3070: the gate asserts a nested .git stays out of the roof-id sweeps (#1241)\n\nThe PR and dev gate died with exit 143 (\"the runner has received a shutdown\nsignal\") on every run from about 09:50 to 13:08 UTC on 2026-10-23. T-3069 (#1238)\nfound the cause: `execute_roof_redeal.py --check-migration` and `--check-blocks`\nread the tickets clone's 1.9 GB `.git` object pack as text, about 10 GB resident\neach, and a 16 GB runner ran out of memory. It fixed that by adding \".git\" to\n`roof_id_pins.NOT_A_SOURCE_DIR`. All nine gate runs since it merged (dev\n587d8f331 through 793804312 and five PR heads) are green, so the gate reaches a\nverdict again. T-3071's blobless tickets clone is a second, independent defence\n(tickets/.git is now about 29 MB).\n\nNothing asserted the rule, so a later edit to NOT_A_SOURCE_DIR could have brought\nthe failure back without any test noticing. The pins self-test now checks that\na nested pack and HEAD are outside the sweep, that ticket files and a `.gitkeep`\nare still inside it, and that the live tree's source list holds no `.git`\nsegment. It also runs a mutation: with \".git\" removed, the pack is swept again.\nReverting the T-3069 line by hand makes the self-test fail.\n\nChangelog: none, because this only changes the gate and visitors see nothing.\n\nCo-authored-by: polecat-steward <steward@polecat.live>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d3b97506ae0ddd9db79ae6b81559ac7314ff876","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/git/trees/8d3b97506ae0ddd9db79ae6b81559ac7314ff876"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/git/commits/ea22b3c3055d0c6d40f213273138103fbc98cee3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq24gICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwyUQAEvnFDtIv9tMqsug4NKAQSsN\nulnEXYu1VCRTnr6csAAbinAYohcYQBcI89DCbM9fXIpJ6VQXX17TUfI7Znos1/fY\nyiMzIpZJ6Gp7d9D6JLA/GQJ0LiC1FJYnXSu2sx/1/9hHFwCeJjvFePXT08J4FcnV\nlDORuMczMttUglmsbzLzZsKmjUI58IKZKBGzxncdUzpoA5r+jZTMkGhRxHWDdxFm\nFmHDAkYQiuMvhnX/5bI/Tazh4/wqWAfW2pArEWKPbNcoVHnKkFgnpLDB7lzjzLJy\nusTgIRMc0z8uAQAvS5XhltviNZnbwogPU9lTcRKJ1BuxxLdhvmMWPrUn9BV7kGVI\nMLxvWHQoWVdHb7OzMIxKjpdpqCr0zI4ONHG/6M1Gwzu++7TfhSfUssD0QAHLTqDS\nwNBhGxIFtVKWPltEmCWesDVMuttE56H3n+0uCaEBGQw7l849U16UPqFjOy/gzWiN\nPtTVbCT7bC0iMcAuBwJx3a0nVD6BJ8Th2wCxIQQCd36uKW1zFImu/ZWX2BjEKWWJ\nb0Hbbgi6G9pzuTPkYZNZE5Z5XIMDEtXfvhCIC372XTktWnCQuwEKoEqbcVfwxTGH\ngVYcktSihMyreBM6PQGqI62wPmyMrnzMWOibY+ZwfRJHNz9UVeFpE2Vt7AOdA3SQ\nqtiwexu38uSdVMRvp/W9\n=uANG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 8d3b97506ae0ddd9db79ae6b81559ac7314ff876\nparent 8710b89815b18ae308521649423541d228ce9d38\nauthor Kevin Haas <kevinroberthaas@gmail.com> 1792772104 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792772104 +0000\n\nT-3070: the gate asserts a nested .git stays out of the roof-id sweeps (#1241)\n\nThe PR and dev gate died with exit 143 (\"the runner has received a shutdown\nsignal\") on every run from about 09:50 to 13:08 UTC on 2026-10-23. T-3069 (#1238)\nfound the cause: `execute_roof_redeal.py --check-migration` and `--check-blocks`\nread the tickets clone's 1.9 GB `.git` object pack as text, about 10 GB resident\neach, and a 16 GB runner ran out of memory. It fixed that by adding \".git\" to\n`roof_id_pins.NOT_A_SOURCE_DIR`. All nine gate runs since it merged (dev\n587d8f331 through 793804312 and five PR heads) are green, so the gate reaches a\nverdict again. T-3071's blobless tickets clone is a second, independent defence\n(tickets/.git is now about 29 MB).\n\nNothing asserted the rule, so a later edit to NOT_A_SOURCE_DIR could have brought\nthe failure back without any test noticing. The pins self-test now checks that\na nested pack and HEAD are outside the sweep, that ticket files and a `.gitkeep`\nare still inside it, and that the live tree's source list holds no `.git`\nsegment. It also runs a mutation: with \".git\" removed, the pack is swept again.\nReverting the T-3069 line by hand makes the self-test fail.\n\nChangelog: none, because this only changes the gate and visitors see nothing.\n\nCo-authored-by: polecat-steward <steward@polecat.live>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-10-23T16:15:04Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/commits/ea22b3c3055d0c6d40f213273138103fbc98cee3","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/commit/ea22b3c3055d0c6d40f213273138103fbc98cee3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/commits/ea22b3c3055d0c6d40f213273138103fbc98cee3/comments","author":{"login":"kevinrhaas","id":4193586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTM1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4193586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/followers","following_url":"ht